  <title>Resource calendar</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Resources</gui><gui>Resource calendar</gui></guiseq>, or the
  <gui>Resource Calendar</gui> button of the main window, shows a month with
  each day's entries in it. Move between months with the arrows beside the
  month's name, or scroll on the calendar. Narrow it by <gui>Type</gui>,
  <gui>Contact</gui> and <gui>Category</gui>.</p>

  <p>Click a day to list its entries below the calendar, with their
  <gui>Subject</gui>, <gui>Qty</gui>, <gui>Type</gui>, <gui>Contact</gui> and
  <gui>Category</gui>. Right click a day to open it in a small window of its
  own, where entries can be changed, added with <gui>New</gui> or removed with
  <gui>Delete</gui>. An entry's <gui>Qty</gui> can be typed as a sum such as
  <input>2x12</input>; see <link xref="qty_arithmetic"/>.</p>

  <p>The window menu sets the <gui>Row width</gui> and <gui>Row height</gui>
  of the days, whether to <gui>Show details</gui>, and has <gui>Save window
  layout</gui>. It also opens <link xref="resource_categories"/> and <link
  xref="resource_management"/>.</p>

</page>
